# Maestro: OpenCloud Space hangar

## Default hangar

**Maestro Space** on `https://cloud.km0digital.com` (account `maestro@km0digital.com`).
Credentials in Maestro `.env` (`OPENCLOUD_*`). Skill: `.cursor/skills/opencloud-space/SKILL.md`.
CLI: `python3 /root/bots/maestro/scripts/opencloud_space.py`.

## Folders

| Path | Use |
|------|-----|
| `human_input/` | Humans → Maestro (read here first) |
| `maestro_input/` | Maestro → humans (write outputs here) |
| `others/` | Misc shared |

## When

Luipy asks to consult or upload Space files, park artifacts, or fetch something they put in the hangar.

## Do not

- Post `OPENCLOUD_*` secrets to Discord.
- Delete Space files without a scoped operator confirmation.
- Use other users’ personal spaces unless Luipy explicitly scopes that.
